# Maven Default Build Options
# ============================
# These options are automatically applied to EVERY mvnw command.
#
# -T 1C         --> Use 1 thread per available CPU core (parallel module builds)
# -Dmaven.artifact.threads=20 --> Download up to 20 dependencies simultaneously
# --no-transfer-progress  --> Suppress noisy download progress bars in the log
# -Dstyle.color=always    --> Keep colored output even when piped
-T 1C
-Dmaven.artifact.threads=20
--no-transfer-progress
